*.bak

# ===== Hardware (KiCad / autorouter scratch) =====
# Only hardware/README.md is tracked by default. Everything else under
# hardware/ is local scratch or not-yet-curated CAD — ignore it so
# `git ls-files -o --exclude-standard hardware/` stays empty.
# Force-add intentional releases: `git add -f hardware/path/to/file`.
/hardware/**
!/hardware/README.md

# Browser integration test dependencies and reports
node_modules/
playwright-report/
test-results/
